          }
        },
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "A judgment-free zone on Marion Ave",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our customers call it a judgment-free zone, and we take that seriously. Michele and the team style you the way a good friend would — honest, warm, and on your side. You'll find size-inclusive racks in every category, one-of-a-kind pieces you won't see on everyone else in town, and prices that don't need a sale to make sense.</p><p>Come in for a swimsuit before the beach, a dress for date night, a gown for the gala, or just to say hi. In-store pickup is always free if you'd rather shop from the couch and swing by later.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
        "button": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "Visit Us",
            "button_link": "shopify://pages/visit-us",
            "button_style_secondary": true
          }
        }
      },
